      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そして……\r\nやはり俺は、レーゲンさんの\r\n本当の子どもではないのだと……。",
        "official_en": "I was clearly cut from a different cloth than Sir Raegen’s real son.",
        "real_en": "And then...\r\nI realized once again that I wasn't\r\nRaegen-san's real child..."
