      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "その時悟ったんだ。\r\nレインと俺では才能が違いすぎることを。",
        "official_en": "Reality crashed down on me in that moment. I realized that Rain’s talents were simply beyond mine.",
        "real_en": "That was when I realized just how far apart Rain's talent and mine really were."
