      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ラスウェルには自分の夢はないの？\r\nレインのためにとかじゃなくて。",
        "official_en": "Don’t you have a dream of your own, instead of thinking of Rain all the time?",
        "real_en": "Don't you have a dream of your own, Lasswell? Something you want for yourself, not for Rain?"
